<title>SINGAPORE: Cycle &amp; Carriage names managing director.</title>
<headline>Cycle &amp; Carriage names managing director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Cycle &amp; Carriage Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Cheah Kim Teck, 45, as the new managing director for its motor operations in Singapore.</p>
<p>A company statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
